cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "AbsorptionCutoff: a Lean 4 formalization of absorption cutoff and stationary singularities for rounded Gaussian random dynamical systems"
version: 1.1.0
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of absorption cutoff and
  stationary singularities for Gaussian random dynamical systems with
  coordinatewise tanh nonlinearity and nearest-grid rounding. The development
  contains no sorry and no custom axiom, and each of its seven headline theorems
  is additionally checked by leanprover/comparator against a restatement written
  in Mathlib vocabulary only.
type: software
authors:
